    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "by K'arn Hollowbeak, Avian scholar\nThe Clipped Council serve as the bridge between the Flightless and the Stargazers. These martyred Avians were amongst the select few who retained the ability to fly, yet allowed Kluex to clip their wings so as to be able to empathise with his subjects.",
    "value": "翼族学者 卡恩·空喙 撰\n断翅议会，乃凡俗之众与观星者之间的桥梁。此等殉道翼族，本为少数保有飞行能力之佼佼者，却甘愿令克鲁西斯断其双翼，以期能感同身受神之子民的境遇。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "The Stargazers rule them, and ferry messages between the council and Kluex through their own powers of flight. Many regard the Clipped Council as the true heroes of Avian society. Willingly sacrificing everything for the good of our species, it is truly a noble pursuit.",
    "value": "观星者统御议会，并藉其残存之飞行能力，于议会与克鲁西斯之间传递信息。众多翼族视断翅议会为社会之真正英雄。为族群福祉而自愿牺牲一切，此确为高尚之举。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "The Grounded, however, seem to have a particular aversion to the council, regarding them as corrupt old has-beens, perpetuating some kind of deception. Such paranoia is baseless and damaging.",
    "value": "然堕地者之流似乎对议会尤为反感，视其为腐败过时之辈，谓其使某种欺瞒。此等偏狭之见，实乃无稽之谈，且贻害匪浅。"
  }
]